  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Indonesia Knowledge Partnerships Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia-Indonesia Knowledge Partnership Platform (KONEKSI) is the Australian Government&apos;s flagship program in the knowledge and innovation sector in Indonesia. The program&apos;s goal is to achieve enduring relationships between Australian and Indonesian institutions that advance mutual interest and support Indonesia&apos;s inclusive and sustainable development. KONEKSI supports partnerships between various institutions in Australia and Indonesia to find innovative policy and technological solutions on issues of shared interests such as climate change, digital transformation, bioeconomy and energy transition. KONEKSI supports competitive research grants, technical assistance, and knowledge management and dissemination. It builds networks and coalition between institutions in both countries. KONEKSI advances people-to-people and institutional links between Australia and Indonesian organisations in research, science, technology and innovation.</narrative>
  </description>
